text In the dream, I rested my head on her shoulder without saying a thing, and did nothing but hug her.
text Then... next to us, Fujibayashi kept looking at us...
text ...while tears silently dripped down her face.
text @[Tomoya]
text Haah...
text Dispirited, I exhale deeply, and slowly turn to look at the clock.
text This is the first time I am late since I started dating Fujibayashi.
