text A familiar scene on the road to school.
text It's a scene I used to see all the time...
text For me... this used to be part of my daily routine.
text Even so... my steps are heavy.
text It's probably because I feel a twinge of guilt toward Fujibayashi for being late.
text No... that isn't why.
text The source of my guilt is something else...
text It comes down to the dream I saw this morning...
text It's why my emotions are in turmoil right now...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text My legs stop.
text If I keep going, then I'll arrive at school.
text If that happens... then I'll have to go to the classroom.
text And... Fujibayashi is there.
text What kind of expression would I have on my face if I go there now?
